::: {align="center"}
# 🛡️ Mini SIEM & Security Analytics Engine

**A local Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) platform for
collecting Linux authentication logs, detecting suspicious activity, and
investigating security alerts.**

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.14%2B-3776AB?logo=python&logoColor=white)
![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/UI-Streamlit-FF4B4B?logo=streamlit&logoColor=white)
![PostgreSQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/Database-PostgreSQL-4169E1?logo=postgresql&logoColor=white)
![Platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-Linux-FCC624?logo=linux&logoColor=black)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Local%20Development-success)
:::

